                                                "sense_id": "ef7f9ccd-22c9-3f1f-ba4c-c20678279f3f",
                                                "text": "This means that changes to the electricity system in favour of decarbonisation will have to come even faster.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5c827eb-e1e8-4513-9bd6-5d69ecb3843f",
                                                "sense_id": "ef7f9ccd-22c9-3f1f-ba4c-c20678279f3f",
                                                "text": "The key sentence appears on page 27 of the 80-page report. It says: \"We recognise that electrifying more of the railway is likely to be necessary to deliver decarbonisation.\"\nA second notable sentence records: \"The main way to achieve rail freight decarbonisation is to stop using diesel traction, through direct government intervention to roll out further electrification.\""
                                            }
